ackend/ source file. Fails unless expected_count matches.", "name": "replace_text", "parameters": {"properties": {"expected_count": {"default": 1, "minimum": 1, "type": "integer"}, "new": {"type": "string"}, "old": {"type": "string"}, "path": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["path", "old", "new"], "type": "object"}}, "type": "function"}, {"function": {"description": "Run a safe deterministic check. Use quick during implementation and full only at batch/final boundaries.", "name": "run_validation", "parameters": {"properties": {"scope": {"enum": ["structure", "quick", "full"], "type": "string"}}, "required": ["scope"], "type": "object"}}, "type": "function"}, {"function": {"description": "Read the original public specification for one abbreviated requirement in this batch, in sequential bounded pages. Continue from next_start_char until complete=true before editing. After the first full read, any page can be reviewed again by start_char, including after context compression.", "name": "read_requirement_spec", "parameters": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"requirement_id": {"enum": ["REQ-1-1-1", "REQ-1-2-1", "REQ-1-2-2", "REQ-1-3-1"], "type": "string"}, "start_char": {"minimum": 0, "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["requirement_id", "start_char"], "type": "object"}}, "type": "function"}, {"function": {"description": "After a passing quick validation, open only the generated local app in Chromium. Inspect visible text/semantic controls, then optionally click, fill, press, select, check, reload or navigate local paths. Use up to 16 actions for one complete user workflow with visible-text assertions; this is not a hidden-test or score oracle. At most three launches per batch. Use steps=[] to inspect controls if names are unknown. Every call starts from fresh seed state at /; records and sessions created in earlier calls are gone. Keep setup, rejection/correction, success and reload in one call when relevant. Do not omit final assertions just to shorten the